  "html": "<div id=\"question-117951\" class=\"question\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                        <div class=\"questionNumber\">Question 6</div>\n\n                        \n                               \n                         \n        \n\n                        \n                            <div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img id=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-117951\"></div>\n                        \n\n                        <div id=\"questionText-117951\" class=\"questionText\">\n                            <p>Order the sides of the triangle <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"23\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25B3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">△</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> above from the shortest to the longest. </p>\n<p> </p>\n                                     \n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                            <table class=\"choicesTable\">\n                                <tbody><tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceALetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-117951-choiceA\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"a\">a</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td class=\"choiceText\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabin